  "_comment": "How each operator lets you VERIFY a request that claims one of its tokens. 'ranges' points at a local snapshot in data/published_ranges/ shaped like the operator's real file; 'rdns' lists hostname suffixes for forward-confirmed reverse DNS. The real URLs are in 'source'. Snapshots use RFC 5737 documentation prefixes: they are NOT the operators' real addresses.",
